{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　　こんばちは　緑がいっぱいの道を走ったとき沖縄の高速道路みたいだな〜と思って沖縄を思い出して沖縄行きたくなりました🥺沖縄〜おきなわ〜OKINAWA〜　　佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFNPRA75JMYZ4KBD1EVK0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nトラファルガー・ローのTシャツを着たのでミーグリにきてくれた方々をシャンブルズしました🐼🧡99巻の新世代がたまらなくて忘れられず、、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFPQXHN6585V4QKD1R2SB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFQSP5JYW5PW4415V6KZP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午後からは、綺麗めで🌬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFRTQ9PB4VV93XZPV144W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFSW0XXHA47ACEW7EG222","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFTYBVA34ZJJNMXZFKQXA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nテーマは、ピクニックだけど鬼ごっこできちゃうよ🧚‍♀️です！スニーカー好き！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFW1DYVFJANB24B2X9HH2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFX3C5ATGH1EAE4YMNX02","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFY3JFW56X4J7H177FSMV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n4部がお休みになってしまったので沢山写真撮ってました🧚‍♀️どの髪型がお好きですか〜ふふ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PFZ417Y5FE3Q0WB9G1RBR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">これは、めいと顔はめパネル写真を撮ってみました🐭このカチューシャの部分に顔をはめてみてください✌️✌️あ、因みにめいの鼻についてるのはシールです🙃"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PG07PC72YGQN5BQV54W6H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">靴紐直し中〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PG17KFJZ011QFT499CBWT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">お部屋にいざとなったら振り回せそうな棒を見つけました嬉しい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせです🚀本日17日19:00〜「THE突破ファイル」に高本と出演させていただきます！是非ご覧ください🍒"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PG29FMG4W6QA8D4TNZV4A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">おたけポテチ🍟"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、高校生クイズのメインサポーターとしてQuizKnockの皆さんと対決致しました🧚‍♀️https://youtu.be/lWAeh7KfKWE\n是非ご覧ください！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PG39TGKW1Q7QBSTWCNWTK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3PG4CNPQ8KGEV4XBGZXS2S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}